ion></figure><p>AV女優拍攝時在想什麼？親曝現場秘辛　最想做的竟是吃便當</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.000827+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1732,"images":28,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T09:15:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:58.932555+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:28.064560+00:00","content_hash":"0cf520b7898a20ff00bfe4041d3fadf2f546e05b1c0bf57d0f45500b71e85855","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}